# Log every access to the DWT model, with values.  Used to answer whether the
# firmware's furi_hal_cortex_delay_us() spin loop sees CYCCNT advance: if the values
# repeat, the emulated clock is not moving while the CPU sits in a translation block,
# and an honest counter can never satisfy the loop (docs/ISSUES_AND_LOGS.md, P21).
#
# WARNING: do not use this for a run you intend to watch.  The firmware's delay loops
# read CYCCNT millions of times (measured: 4,000,000 reads for the single
# furi_delay_us(4000000) in furi_hal_power_init), so every one of them also costs a log
# line and the boot never reaches its first draw - a 20 s run with this include logged
# 1,803,772 lines and left the panel stream at 0 bytes.  Keep traced runs short and
# targeted (docs/BRINGUP_LOG.md, §22).
sysbus LogPeripheralAccess dwt
